---
description: Ironwallet transfers and swaps — hot wallet, no blind retries
alwaysApply: false
---

The limiter is the wallet balance. Prefer a dedicated hot wallet with limited
funds. The agent may send and swap without a per-transaction confirmation UI.
Do not add fake amount caps, rate limits, or modals.

If `send_transfer` or `execute_swap` times out, poll `get_operation_status` /
`get_swap_status` before retrying. Do not resubmit blindly.
